@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed scoped candidate review and implementation handoff
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Identify source / design / ADR revisions and claimed scope;
:Gate A — exact traceability and consistent candidate;
:Gate B — sufficient scope-specific technical prescriptions;
:Gate C — applicable feasibility and verification prerequisites;
if (Required evidence / decisions sufficient for claimed scope?) then (yes)
 :Gate D — owner disposition and delivery alignment;\npreserve baseline sequence and actual capacity;
 if (Actual scoped disposition recorded?) then (yes)
  :Handoff only the identified permitted scope;\nretain residual risks and later product-readiness gates;
 else (no)
  :Record pending disposition;\ndo not infer coding or phase approval;
 endif
else (no)
 :Record exact gap and blocked commitment;\ncontinue independent work where applicable;
endif
